rling, including their habitats, physical features, and threats. u b u u u u u u u u u u  u u u u u u  u u u u u u u u  u u u u u u u u u u u u u u u u u u u u u u u u u u u u u u u u u u u u u u u  u u Add one clear supporting detail and a concluding sentence.', 'The Cendrawasih is a beautiful endemic bird found in Papua, Indonesia. It is known for its colourful feathers, which are used by the male to attract females. Unfortunately, Cendrawasih is threatened by habitat destruction and illegal hunting. Therefore, conservation efforts are very important to protect this species.', '0.620', 'fallback', 'completed', '2026-08-01 18:39:29');
