bird with pure white feathers. Its most striking features are the bright blue skin around its eyes and a beautiful crest on its head. This bird lives only in the dry monsoon forests and savanna areas of western Bali. Unfortunately, its population is highly critically endangered in the wild today. The biggest threat this species faces is illegal poaching for the exotic pet trade, which continues to drive them toward extinction. . . Add one clear supporting detail and a concluding sentence.', 'The Cendrawasih is a beautiful endemic bird found in Papua, Indonesia. It is known for its colourful feathers, which are used by the male to attract females. Unfortunately, Cendrawasih is threatened by habitat destruction and illegal hunting. Therefore, conservation efforts are very important to protect this species.', '0.620', 'fallback', 'completed', '2026-08-01 18:40:54');
INSERT INTO `assessment_results` (`id`, `attempt_id`, `skill`, `criteria_json`, `total_score`, `maximum_score`, `strengths_json`, `improvements_json`, `grammar_notes_json`, `vocabulary_notes_json`, `suggested_revision`, `example_answer`, `confidence`, `source`, `status`, `created_at`) VALUES ('3', '49', 'writing', '[{\"name\": \"task_completion\", \"score\": 85, \"feedback\": \"Fallback heuristic based on transcript/text length, required concepts, sentence completeness, and lexical variety.\", \"max_score\": 100}, {\"name\": \"relevance\", \"score\": 100, \"feedback\": \"Fallback heuristic based on transcript/text length, required concepts, sentence completeness, and lexical variety.\", \"max_score\": 100}, {\"name\": \"grammar\", \"score\": 100, \"feedback\": \"Fallback heuristic based on transcript/text length, required concepts, sentence completeness, and lexical variety.\", \"max_score\": 100}, {\"name\": \"vocabulary\", \"score\": 100, \"feedback\": \"Fallback heuristic based on transcript/text length, required concepts, sentence completeness, and lexical variety.\", \"max_score\": 100}, {\"name\": \"organization\", \"score\": 100, \"feedback\": \"Fallback heuristic based on transcript/text length, required concepts, sentence completeness, and lexical variety.\", \"max_score\": 100}, {\"name\": \"coherence\", \"score\": 100, \"feedback\": \"Fallback heuristic based on transcript/text length, required concepts, sentence completeness, and lexical variety.\", \"max_score\": 100}, {\"name\": \"mechanics\", \"score\": 100, \"feedback\": \"Fallback heuristic based on transcript/text length, required concepts, sentence completeness, and lexical variety.\", \"max_score\": 100}]', '98.00', '100.00', '[\"A response was submitted successfully.\"]', '[\"Add more precise details and varied sentence structures.\"]', '[\"Review sentence boundaries and verb consistency.\"]', '[\"Use more topic-specific vocabulary where appropriate.\"]', 'Here are the requested passive voice sentences and their explanation in English:(1) The Helmeted Hornbill is hunted by hunters for its casque.(2) Cendrawasih is studied by scientists in Papua.In passive voice, the object becomes the new subject. We use is combined with the past participle verb. Sentence one focuses on the bird being targeted for its valuable head part. Sentence two highlights that the bird is the focus of scientific research. Both sentences change focus from the actors to the unique Indonesian animals. Add one clear supporting detail and a concluding sentence.', 'The Cendrawasih is a beautiful endemic bird found in Papua, Indonesia. It is known for its colourful feathers, which are used by the male to attract females. Unfortunately, Cendrawasih is threatened by habitat destruction and illegal hunting. Therefore, conservation efforts are very important to protect this species.', '0.620', 'fallback', 'completed', '2026-08-01 18:45:33');
INSERT INTO `assessment_results` (`id`, `attempt_id`, `skill`, `criteria_json`, `total_score`, `maximum_score`, `strengths_json`, `improvements_json`, `grammar_notes_json`, `vocabulary_notes_json`, `suggested_revision`, `example_answer`, `confidence`, `source`, `status`, `created_at`) VALUES ('4', '50', 'writing', '[{\"name\": \"task_completion\", \"score\": 85, \"feedback\": \"Fallback heuristic based on transcript/text length, required concepts, sentence completeness, and lexical variety.\", \"max_score\": 100}, {\"name\": \"relevance\", \"score\": 100, \"feedback\": \"Fallback heuristic based on transcript/text length, required concepts, sentence completeness, and lexical variety.\", \"max_score\": 100}, {\"name\": \"grammar\", \"score\": 100, \"feedback\": \"Fallback heuristic based on transcript/text length, required concepts, sentence completeness, and lexical variety.\", \"max_score\": 100}, {\"name\": \"vocabulary\", \"score\": 100, \"feedback\": \"Fallback heuristic based on transcript/text length, required concepts, sentence completeness, and lexical variety.\", \"max_score\": 100}, {\"name\": \"organization\", \"score\": 100, \"feedback\": \"Fallback heuristic based on transcript/text length, required concepts, sentence completeness, and lexical variety.\", \"max_score\": 100}, {\"name\": \"coherence\", \"score\": 100, \"feedback\": \"Fallback heuristic based on transcript/text length, required concepts, sentence completeness, and lexical variety.\", \"max_score\": 100}, {\"name\": \"mechanics\", \"score\": 100, \"feedback\": \"Fallback heuristic based on transcript/text length, required concepts, sentence completeness, and lexical variety.\", \"max_score\": 100}]', '98.00', '100.00', '[\"A response was submitted successfully.\"]', '[\"Add more precise details and varied sentence structures.\"]', '[\"Review sentence boundaries and verb consistency.\"]', '[\"Use more topic-specific vocabulary where appropriate.\"]', 'The passive voice is a grammatical structure where the subject receives the action instead of performing it. It emphasizes the receiver of the action rather than the doer. The basic formula uses Subject + To Be + Past Participle (Verb 3). This structure is very useful in scientific or descriptive reports when the action or the animal being discussed is more important than who is doing the action.Here are three examples about Indonesian fauna using this structure:The Bali Starling is protected by strict Indonesian government laws.The exotic Cendrawasih is admired by birdwatchers for its colorful courtship dance.The Helmeted Hornbill is severely impacted by continuous habitat loss in the rainforest. Add one clear supporting detail and a concluding sentence.', 'The Cendrawasih is a beautiful endemic bird found in Papua, Indonesia. It is known for its colourful feathers, which are used by the male to attract females. Unfortunately, Cendrawasih is threatened by habitat destruction and illegal hunting. Therefore, conservation efforts are very important to protect this species.', '0.620', 'fallback', 'completed', '2026-08-01 18:46:28');
INSERT INTO `assessment_results` (`id`, `attempt_id`, `skill`, `criteria_json`, `total_score`, `maximum_score`, `strengths_json`, `improvements_json`, `grammar_notes_json`, `vocabulary_notes_json`, `suggested_revision`, `example_answer`, `confidence`, `source`, `status`, `created_at`) VALUES ('5', '51', 'writing', '[{\"name\": \"task_completion\", \"score\": 85, \"feedback\": \"Fallback heuristic based on transcript/text length, required concepts, sentence completeness, and lexical variety.\", \"max_score\": 100}, {\"name\": \"relevance\", \"score\": 100, \"feedback\": \"Fallback heuristic based on transcript/text length, required concepts, sentence completeness, and lexical variety.\", \"max_score\": 100}, {\"name\": \"grammar\", \"score\": 100, \"feedback\": \"Fallback heuristic based on transcript/text length, required concepts, sentence completeness, and lexical variety.\", \"max_score\": 100}, {\"name\": \"vocabulary\", \"score\": 100, \"feedback\": \"Fallback heuristic based on transcript/text length, required concepts, sentence completeness, and lexical variety.\", \"max_score\": 100}, {\"name\": \"organization\", \"score\": 100, \"feedback\": \"Fallback heuristic based on transcript/text length, required concepts, sentence completeness, and lexical variety.\", \"max_score\": 100}, {\"name\": \"coherence\", \"score\": 100, \"feedback\": \"Fallback heuristic based on transcript/text length, required concepts, sentence completeness, and lexical variety.\", \"max_score\": 100}, {\"name\": \"mechanics\", \"score\": 100, \"feedback\": \"Fallback heuristic based on transcript/text length, required concepts, sentence completeness, and lexical variety.\", \"max_score\": 100}]', '98.00', '100.00', '[\"A response was submitted successfully.\"]', '[\"Add more precise details and varied sentence structures.\"]', '[\"Review sentence boundaries and verb consistency.\"]', '[\"Use more topic-specific vocabulary where appropriate.\"]', '\"Critically endangered\" means a species faces an extremely high risk of extinction in the wild in the immediate future. This is the highest risk category assigned by the IUCN Red List for wild organisms. It indicates that the species has suffered a drastic population decline, habitat destruction, or severe fragmentation.The Bali Starling is a perfect example from the lesson material. This bird is classified as critically endangered due to severe habitat loss and rampant illegal poaching for the pet trade. Add one clear supporting detail and a concluding sentence.', 'The Cendrawasih is a beautiful endemic bird found in Papua, Indonesia. It is known for its colourful feathers, which are used by the male to attract females. Unfortunately, Cendrawasih is threatened by habitat destruction and illegal hunting. Therefore, conservation efforts are very important to protect this species.', '0.620', 'fallback', 'completed', '2026-08-01 18:47:25');
