ted HornbillClassification: BirdHabitat: Tropical rainforestsDiet: Fruits and insectsThreats: Poaching and deforestationThe Helmeted Hornbill is a large, unique bird native to the dense forests of Sumatra and Kalimantan. It plays a vital ecological role by dispersing fruit seeds across the jungle. Unfortunately, this species faces severe threats. Hunters target the bird for its solid, valuable ivory casque. Combined with massive habitat loss from illegal logging, its population continues to decline rapidly toward extinction. . . . . Add one clear supporting detail and a concluding sentence.', 'The Cendrawasih is a beautiful endemic bird found in Papua, Indonesia. It is known for its colourful feathers, which are used by the male to attract females. Unfortunately, Cendrawasih is threatened by habitat destruction and illegal hunting. Therefore, conservation efforts are very important to protect this species.', '0.620', 'fallback', 'completed', '2026-08-01 19:02:56');
INSERT INTO `assessment_results` (`id`, `attempt_id`, `skill`, `criteria_json`, `total_score`, `maximum_score`, `strengths_json`, `improvements_json`, `grammar_notes_json`, `vocabulary_notes_json`, `suggested_revision`, `example_answer`, `confidence`, `source`, `status`, `created_at`) VALUES ('7', '53', 'writing', '[{\"name\": \"task_completion\", \"score\": 85, \"feedback\": \"Fallback heuristic based on transcript/text length, required concepts, sentence completeness, and lexical variety.\", \"max_score\": 100}, {\"name\": \"relevance\", \"score\": 100, \"feedback\": \"Fallback heuristic based on transcript/text length, required concepts, sentence completeness, and lexical variety.\", \"max_score\": 100}, {\"name\": \"grammar\", \"score\": 100, \"feedback\": \"Fallback heuristic based on transcript/text length, required concepts, sentence completeness, and lexical variety.\", \"max_score\": 100}, {\"name\": \"vocabulary\", \"score\": 100, \"feedback\": \"Fallback heuristic based on transcript/text length, required concepts, sentence completeness, and lexical variety.\", \"max_score\": 100}, {\"name\": \"organization\", \"score\": 100, \"feedback\": \"Fallback heuristic based on transcript/text length, required concepts, sentence completeness, and lexical variety.\", \"max_score\": 100}, {\"name\": \"coherence\", \"score\": 100, \"feedback\": \"Fallback heuristic based on transcript/text length, required concepts, sentence completeness, and lexical variety.\", \"max_score\": 100}, {\"name\": \"mechanics\", \"score\": 100, \"feedback\": \"Fallback heuristic based on transcript/text length, required concepts, sentence completeness, and lexical variety.\", \"max_score\": 100}]', '98.00', '100.00', '[\"A response was submitted successfully.\"]', '[\"Add more precise details and varied sentence structures.\"]', '[\"Review sentence boundaries and verb consistency.\"]', '[\"Use more topic-specific vocabulary where appropriate.\"]', 'Conservation Message: Protect Indonesian Endemic BirdsIndonesia\'s unique birds are priceless natural treasures that we must protect. Today, the magnificent Cendrawasih in Papua is threatened by severe deforestation of its native rainforest habitat. Meanwhile, the beautiful Bali Starling faces critical extinction due to rampant illegal poaching for the pet trade. Losing them would destroy our forest ecosystems. We must stop illegal wildlife trafficking and support habitat preservation. Save Indonesia\'s endemic birds before they vanish from the wild forever! . . . Add one clear supporting detail and a concluding sentence.', 'The Cendrawasih is a beautiful endemic bird found in Papua, Indonesia. It is known for its colourful feathers, which are used by the male to attract females. Unfortunately, Cendrawasih is threatened by habitat destruction and illegal hunting. Therefore, conservation efforts are very important to protect this species.', '0.620', 'fallback', 'completed', '2026-08-01 19:04:01');
INSERT INTO `assessment_results` (`id`, `attempt_id`, `skill`, `criteria_json`, `total_score`, `maximum_score`, `strengths_json`, `improvements_json`, `grammar_notes_json`, `vocabulary_notes_json`, `suggested_revision`, `example_answer`, `confidence`, `source`, `status`, `created_at`) VALUES ('8', '54', 'writing', '[{\"name\": \"task_completion\", \"score\": 85, \"feedback\": \"Fallback heuristic based on transcript/text length, required concepts, sentence completeness, and lexical variety.\", \"max_score\": 100}, {\"name\": \"relevance\", \"score\": 100, \"feedback\": \"Fallback heuristic based on transcript/text length, required concepts, sentence completeness, and lexical variety.\", \"max_score\": 100}, {\"name\": \"grammar\", \"score\": 100, \"feedback\": \"Fallback heuristic based on transcript/text length, required concepts, sentence completeness, and lexical variety.\", \"max_score\": 100}, {\"name\": \"vocabulary\", \"score\": 100, \"feedback\": \"Fallback heuristic based on transcript/text length, required concepts, sentence completeness, and lexical variety.\", \"max_score\": 100}, {\"name\": \"organization\", \"score\": 100, \"feedback\": \"Fallback heuristic based on transcript/text length, required concepts, sentence completeness, and lexical variety.\", \"max_score\": 100}, {\"name\": \"coherence\", \"score\": 100, \"feedback\": \"Fallback heuristic based on transcript/text length, required concepts, sentence completeness, and lexical variety.\", \"max_score\": 100}, {\"name\": \"mechanics\", \"score\": 100, \"feedback\": \"Fallback heuristic based on transcript/text length, required concepts, sentence completeness, and lexical variety.\", \"max_score\": 100}]', '98.00', '100.00', '[\"A response was submitted successfully.\"]', '[\"Add more precise details and varied sentence structures.\"]', '[\"Review sentence boundaries and verb consistency.\"]', '[\"Use more topic-specific vocabulary where appropriate.\"]', 'Chapter 1 - Exploring Fauna of Indonesia (Unit 1) introduces the fascinating Bekantan, an endemic primate native to Borneo. These unique arboreal animals mainly inhabit dense mangrove forests near rivers and coastal regions. Their specialized diet consists primarily of young leaves, mangrove shoots, seeds, and unripe fruits. Sadly, due to extensive habitat destruction, logging, and forest conversion, their wild population faces a major threat. Consequently, the IUCN lists the Bekantan as an endangered species, requiring urgent regional conservation efforts. . Add one clear supporting detail and a concluding sentence.', 'The Cendrawasih is a beautiful endemic bird found in Papua, Indonesia. It is known for its colourful feathers, which are used by the male to attract females. Unfortunately, Cendrawasih is threatened by habitat destruction and illegal hunting. Therefore, conservation efforts are very important to protect this species.', '0.620', 'fallback', 'completed', '2026-08-01 19:04:54');
INSERT INTO `assessment_results` (`id`, `attempt_id`, `skill`, `criteria_json`, `total_score`, `maximum_score`, `strengths_json`, `improvements_json`, `grammar_notes_json`, `vocabulary_notes_json`, `suggested_revision`, `example_answer`, `confidence`, `source`, `status`, `created_at`) VALUES ('9', '55', 'writing', '[{\"name\": \"task_completion\", \"score\": 85, \"feedback\": \"Fallback heuristic based on transcript/text length, required concepts, sentence completeness, and lexical variety.\", \"max_score\": 100}, {\"name\": \"relevance\", \"score\": 100, \"feedback\": \"Fallback heuristic based on transcript/text length, required concepts, sentence completeness, and lexical variety.\", \"max_score\": 100}, {\"name\": \"grammar\", \"score\": 100, \"feedback\": \"Fallback heuristic based on transcript/text length, required concepts, sentence completeness, and lexical variety.\", \"max_score\": 100}, {\"name\": \"vocabulary\", \"score\": 100, \"feedback\": \"Fallback heuristic based on transcript/text length, required concepts, sentence completeness, and lexical variety.\", \"max_score\": 100}, {\"name\": \"organization\", \"score\": 100, \"feedback\": \"Fallback heuristic based on transcript/text length, required concepts, sentence completeness, and lexical variety.\", \"max_score\": 100}, {\"name\": \"coherence\", \"score\": 100, \"feedback\": \"Fallback heuristic based on transcript/text length, required concepts, sentence completeness, and lexical variety.\", \"max_score\": 100}, {\"name\": \"mechanics\", \"score\": 100, \"feedback\": \"Fallback heuristic based on transcript/text length, required concepts, sentence completeness, and lexical variety.\", \"max_score\": 100}]', '98.00', '100.00', '[\"A response was submitted successfully.\"]', '[\"Add more precise details and varied sentence structures.\"]', '[\"Review sentence boundaries and verb consistency.\"]', '[\"Use more topic-specific vocabulary where appropriate.\"]', 'Indonesian endemic animals like the Cendrawasih, Helmeted Hornbill, and Bali Starling urgently need strict protection for two main reasons:\r\nFirst, they play a vital role in maintaining ecosystem balance. For instance, the Helmeted Hornbill acts as a natural forest engineer by dispersing fruit seeds across vast areas, which directly helps the natural regeneration of tropical rainforests.\r\nSecond, endemic species face a very high risk of extinction. Because they live exclusively in one specific geographic area, localized habitat destruction or illegal poaching can quickly wipe out their entire global population. Add one clear supporting detail and a concluding sentence.', 'The Cendrawasih is a beautiful endemic bird found in Papua, Indonesia. It is known for its colourful feathers, which are used by the male to attract females. Unfortunately, Cendrawasih is threatened by habitat destruction and illegal hunting. Therefore, conservation efforts are very important to protect this species.', '0.620', 'fallback', 'completed', '2026-08-01 19:05:48');
INSERT INTO `assessment_results` (`id`, `attempt_id`, `skill`, `criteria_json`, `total_score`, `maximum_score`, `strengths_json`, `improvements_json`, `grammar_notes_json`, `vocabulary_notes_json`, `suggested_revision`, `example_answer`, `confidence`, `source`, `status`, `created_at`) VALUES ('10', '56', 'writing', '[{\"name\": \"task_completion\", \"score\": 85, \"feedback\": \"Fallback heuristic based on transcript/text length, required concepts, sentence completeness, and lexical variety.\", \"max_score\": 100}, {\"name\": \"relevance\", \"score\": 100, \"feedback\": \"Fallback heuristic based on transcript/text length, required concepts, sentence completeness, and lexical variety.\", \"max_score\": 100}, {\"name\": \"grammar\", \"score\": 100, \"feedback\": \"Fallback heuristic based on transcript/text length, required concepts, sentence completeness, and lexical variety.\", \"max_score\": 100}, {\"name\": \"vocabulary\", \"score\": 100, \"feedback\": \"Fallback heuristic based on transcript/text length, required concepts, sentence completeness, and lexical variety.\", \"max_score\": 100}, {\"name\": \"organization\", \"score\": 100, \"feedback\": \"Fallback heuristic based on transcript/text length, required concepts, sentence completeness, and lexical variety.\", \"max_score\": 100}, {\"name\": \"coherence\", \"score\": 100, \"feedback\": \"Fallback heuristic based on transcript/text length, required concepts, sentence completeness, and lexical variety.\", \"max_score\": 100}, {\"name\": \"mechanics\", \"score\": 100, \"feedback\": \"Fallback heuristic based on transcript/text length, required concepts, sentence completeness, and lexical variety.\", \"max_score\": 100}]', '98.00', '100.00', '[\"A response was submitted successfully.\"]', '[\"Add more precise details and varied sentence structures.\"]', '[\"Review sentence boundaries and verb consistency.\"]', '[\"Use more topic-specific vocabulary where appropriate.\"]', 'The Cendrawasih and Bali Starling are both unique Indonesian birds facing severe extinction threats. However, they differ significantly in their characteristics. The Cendrawasih lives in the dense, wet rainforests of Papua, while the Bali Starling inhabits the dry savanna woodlands of western Bali. In appearance, the Cendrawasih is famous for its vibrant, multicolored plumage, whereas the Bali Starling has simple, pure white feathers with a bright blue patch around its eyes. Behaviorally, male Cendrawasih perform elaborate courtship dances high in the canopy to attract mates, while Bali Starlings are more social, frequently gathering in small groups to forage for seeds and insects closer to the ground. Add one clear supporting detail and a concluding sentence.', 'The Cendrawasih is a beautiful endemic bird found in Papua, Indonesia. It is known for its colourful feathers, which are used by the male to attract females. Unfortunately, Cendrawasih is threatened by habitat destruction and illegal hunting. Therefore, conservation efforts are very important to protect this species.', '0.620', 'fallback', 'completed', '2026-08-01 19:07:14');
