_____________________ Birdwatchers observe birds&#039; appearance and behavior.→ _________________________________ Birdwatchers observe birds&#039; appearance and behavior. → _________________________________ Kunci Jawaban: Kunci Jawaban: Binoculars are brought by Galang to the forest. Binoculars are brought by Galang to the forest. A helmeted hornbill is seen by Monita. A helmeted hornbill is seen by Monita. A notebook is taken by Pipit when she does the birdwatch. A notebook is taken by Pipit when she does the birdwatch. Helmeted hornbills are hunted by some people for their casques. Helmeted hornbills are hunted by some people for their casques. Birds&#039; appearance and behavior are observed by birdwatchers. Birds&#039; appearance and behavior are observed by birdwatchers. Worksheet 2: Fill in the blanks with the correct passive form Worksheet 2: Fill in the blanks with the correct passive form (Berdasarkan teks tentang Bali Starling di halaman 69) (Berdasarkan teks tentang Bali Starling di halaman 69) Poaching for illegal songbird trade __________ (consider) a major threat for Bali starlings. Poaching for illegal songbird trade __________ (consider) a major threat for Bali starlings. The Bali starling __________ (know) as the national bird of Bali. The Bali starling __________ (know) as the national bird of Bali. Their habitat __________ (destroy) by human activities. Their habitat __________ (destroy) by human activities. Breeding and reintroduction programmes __________ (conduct) to save the species. Breeding and reintroduction programmes __________ (conduct) to save the species. Many birds __________ (protect) by law in Indonesia. Many birds __________ (protect) by law in Indonesia. Kunci Jawaban: Kunci Jawaban: is considered is considered is known is known is destroyed is destroyed are conducted are conducted are protected are protected J. KUNCI JAWABAN ASESMEN (TAMBAHAN) J. KUNCI JAWABAN ASESMEN (TAMBAHAN) Asesmen Awal (Diagnostik): Asesmen Awal (Diagnostik): (Jawaban bervariasi) Contoh: Cendrawasih, Jalak Bali, Elang Jawa, Merpati, Gereja (Jawaban bervariasi) Contoh: Cendrawasih, Jalak Bali, Elang Jawa, Merpati, Gereja Report text menyajikan fakta umum tentang suatu kelompok benda/hewan; descriptive text mendeskripsikan satu objek spesifik. Report text menyajikan fakta umum tentang suatu kelompok benda/hewan; descriptive text mendeskripsikan satu objek spesifik. The Cendrawasih bird has blue, yellow, and green feathers. The Cendrawasih bird has blue, yellow, and green feathers. (Sesuai pengalaman siswa) (Sesuai pengalaman siswa) Mengetahui Mengetahui Kepala Sekolah Kepala Sekolah Almam Faluki, S.Th.I Almam Faluki, S.Th.I Guru Mata Pelajaran Guru Mata Pelajaran Encup Supriatin, S.Pd. Encup Supriatin, S.Pd.', '1', '1', '2026-07-31 20:54:12');
